~ find_angel
Vesper: There is a noble angel standing before the altar. On the altar, there is a young girl. She possesses both demonic and angelic traits. She seems to be in great agony.
- Sneak away
	*Angel didn't notice you..*
- Save The Girl
	Girl:    "Let go of me! I haven’t done anything wrong!"
	Angel:    "Silence! I will not listen to the words of an abomination like you!"
	Girl:    "I am not an abomination!"
	Angel:    "Angelic wings and halo combined with these filthy demonic horns and tail?! I have never seen anything more disgusting in my life. You are a bad omen and therefore shall be ritually executed."
	Vesper:    "Hey! Let go of her! She is just a child."
	Angel:    "What??! You dare to call this abominatio this… this PURE EVIL a child?"
	Vesper: "You truly must have lost your mind. You shall be purged by my divine blade!"
	do fight()
=> END